, "model_id": "gpt-6.2-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "declared", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-6.2-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-6.2-sol:declared", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-p1-27-constructions-d022", "schema_version": 2, "source_adoption_id": "p1-27-constructions-d022", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3366ee4021c344f99656b4a3b4691e8562dfcb5785bbdd2b4fe5fa1c5d0945d1", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "全局截面"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个分次环（graded ring），作为<MATH_0002>-代数（algebra）由<MATH_0003>的元素（elements）生成。在这种情形下，概形（scheme）<MATH_0004>表示如下函子（functor）：它为概形（scheme）<MATH_0005>赋予一个集合（set），其成员为二元组（pairs）<MATH_0006>，其中\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0007>是可逆（invertible）的<MATH_0008>-模（module），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0009>是分次环（graded ring）同态（homomorphism），使得<MATH_0010>由全局截面（global sections）<MATH_0011>生成，其中<MATH_0012>\n<STRUCT_0004>\n这些二元组按上述严格（strict）等价（equivalence）视为相同。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:9e4fb0bd32aac63e867d9c0b587e4f24ed2572792ddb69b297a2d8a14446a92b", "unit_id": "tag:01NA:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "描述引理所设的环。", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "描述该环在生成条件中的代数结构。", "source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "指生成该代数的元素。", "source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"context": "指表示该函子的对象。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "指由该概形表示的函子。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "指该函子的输入对象。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "指该函子赋予输入对象的集合。", "source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "指集合中按给定等价关系理解的二元组。", "source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"context": "限定二元组中的模。", "source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"context": "指出二元组中可逆对象的类型。", "source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"context": "指同态所涉及的环结构。", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "指出二元组中映射的类型。", "source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"context": "指满足生成条件的一组截面。", "source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "全局截面"}, {"context": "限定上文所述的等价。", "source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格"}, {"context": "指判定二元组何时视为相同的关系。", "source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}]}
